<!doctype html><html lang="en-CA"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Get-Involved | PictureThis Production</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"/></head><body><a href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="masthead"><a href="/"><b>PICTURETHIS PRODUCTION</b></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/programs/">Programs</a><a href="/faithfire/">Faithfire</a><a href="/projects/">Projects</a><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/events/">Events</a><a href="/partners/">Partners</a><a class="nav-action" href="/get-involved/">Get Involved</a><a href="/donate/">Donate</a></nav></header><main id="main"><section class="page-opening"><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/8412361.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Two camera operators working beside production cameras" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><h2>Get involved</h2><p></p></section><section><h2>Join a cohort</h2><p>Ages 16 to 29, no experience needed. Applications open for January.</p></section><section><h2>Mentor</h2><p>Working technicians: one participant, monthly check-ins, real shows together. Screening and a code of conduct apply, and we will walk you through both.</p></section><section><h2>Partner or donate</h2><p>Venues, schools, churches and companies: host a training day, lend gear, fund a cohort, or hire our graduates for your calls.</p></section><section><a href={"mailto:"+contactEmail}>{contactEmail}</a></section></main><footer><p>Training: Faithfire Production, 139 Millwick Dr, Toronto.</p><p>PictureThis Production is being set up as a nonprofit organization in Ontario.</p><p>Faithfire Production is its production arm.</p><a href="/policies/">Our standards & policies</a> · <a href={"mailto:"+contactEmail}>{contactEmail}</a> · Placeholder contact</footer><script>document.querySelectorAll("header nav a").forEach(a=>{if(a.getAttribute("href")===location.pathname)a.setAttribute("aria-current","page")})</script></body></html>